{"id":2213,"tv":35868,"how":"map","fit":"odd","eps":[{"n":1,"se":1,"ep":1,"t":"The Order of Operations / The Missing Needle","d":"2004-10-11","r":50,"ov":"A ferry trip goes bad, and Black Jack saves an Iriomote cat, a baby, and a politician, in that order. The politician sues, but Black Jack saves him from cancer, and he relents. Pinoko saves Sharaku from Kong, a bully, and they become friends. Then, Sharaku becomes sick and Black Jack operates on him, but a runaway gurney causes an IV needle to break off in his vein. Black Jack fails to extract the needle, but by a miracle it comes out on its own.","st":"/fVtf1N9SyTaPHnMITtMoVmUHvNo.jpg"},{"n":2,"se":1,"ep":2,"t":"The Ant's Legs","d":"2004-10-18","r":25,"st":"/1FlJxQe7KXh2DCxSL8DTu6D9oaU.jpg"},{"n":3,"se":1,"ep":3,"t":"Playing Doctor","d":"2004-11-01","r":25,"st":"/1gaHFEqcjdJRwPEu0p90752vS16.jpg"},{"n":4,"se":1,"ep":4,"t":"The Sixth-Magnitude Man","d":"2004-11-08","r":25,"st":"/3qSeF1xKHPm7bbRNr7dcL0Jhkud.jpg"},{"n":5,"se":1,"ep":5,"t":"A Teacher and a Pupil","d":"2004-11-15","r":25,"st":"/eVnkOXZRoyusUdGpk441VIuW0LL.jpg"},{"n":6,"se":1,"ep":6,"t":"White Lion","d":"2004-11-22","r":25,"st":"/683dZK78mjHFc2weNmYzM9DNPeZ.jpg"},{"n":7,"se":1,"ep":7,"t":"The Miracle Arm","d":"2004-11-29","r":25,"st":"/tPyU0IQd2t0KrvYpAf7l0ZUYks5.jpg"},{"n":8,"se":1,"ep":8,"t":"Moraimizu","d":"2004-12-06","r":25,"st":"/6bK61elxuthESHsAAGQTP9pzhJ7.jpg"},{"n":9,"se":1,"ep":9,"t":"Legend of the Phoenix","d":"2004-12-13","r":25,"st":"/4OmfFVTRpF7exLdlwmiJnIRtRay.jpg"},{"n":10,"se":1,"ep":10,"t":"The Gift from a Killer Whale","d":"2005-01-17","r":25,"st":"/yWyfTklhf1qDrHacikFiRvyMuHD.jpg"},{"n":11,"se":1,"ep":11,"t":"Give My Brother Back!","d":"2005-01-24","r":25,"st":"/3OC5lNsPcpsiUPiBsAaJnwqpK60.jpg"},{"n":12,"se":1,"ep":12,"t":"A Pirate's Arm","d":"2005-01-31","r":25,"st":"/n28v5bvBuP8fegbTtBs4c8Tjhdb.jpg"},{"n":13,"se":1,"ep":13,"t":"Move, Solomon","d":"2005-02-07","r":25,"st":"/yiMMBPJPD2t2ZZ4LdWExaIygiXa.jpg"},{"n":14,"se":1,"ep":14,"t